{"run": "20261019-235426-d2-science-steps-sonnet-i1", "scenario": "d2-science-steps", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": false, "score": 0.8125, "objectives": 4, "met": 3, "cost": 4.199, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 43.2, "calls": 254, "obj_secs": {"red-automated": 422, "green-automated": 724, "six-labs": 844}, "think_min": 22.6, "idle_min": 5.8, "failed_calls": 12, "undone": 7, "looks": 119, "extra_looks": 59, "waste": 0.307, "cost_per_met": 1.4, "top_failures": [["FAILED no inserter in inventory", 24], ["FAILED nothing to take from stone-furnace (iron-plate) (it holds N coal, N iron-ore); near", 7], ["FAILED no assembling-machineN in inventory", 7], ["FAILED no machine at N,N", 7], ["FAILED nothing to take from stone-furnace (iron-plate) (it holds nothing); nearest with ir", 2], ["FAILED nothing to take from stone-furnace (iron-plate) (it holds N coal); nearest with iro", 2]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED could not queue railway (missing prerequisites or queue full)", "FAILED create_entity failed for splitter", "FAILED no assembling-machineN in inventory", "FAILED no inserter in inventory", "FAILED no machine at N,N", "FAILED no path to N,N (blocked by water/cliffs/buildings?)", "FAILED nothing to take from iron-chest (coal) (it holds nothing); nearest with coal: N at ", "FAILED nothing to take from stone-furnace (iron-plate) (it holds N coal); nearest with iro", "FAILED nothing to take from stone-furnace (iron-plate) (it holds N coal, N iron-ore); near", "FAILED nothing to take from stone-furnace (iron-plate) (it holds nothing); nearest with ir", "FAILED placed N of N transport-belt from N,N to N,N; failed: no transport-belt in", "FAILED route needs N transport-belt but crafting fell short (have N)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:connect", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:research", "act:rotate", "act:set_recipe", "act:take", "act:wait", "build", "designs", "diagnose", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "notes", "production", "recipes", "say", "stop", "techs", "wait", "work"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 6.03, "idle (nothing running)": 5.82, "waiting on jobs": 2.14, "failed calls": 1.45, "walking": 0.58, "blueprint/line building": 0.51, "crafting/fetching": 0.23, "looking": 0.02, "other": 0.01, "thinking": 22.6}, "by_tool": {"act": 69, "inspect": 47, "wait": 29, "map": 21, "say": 17, "find": 16, "look": 14, "diagnose": 13, "production": 8, "build": 5, "techs": 4, "notes": 3}, "debrief": ["Debrief: (1) Most time went on diagnosing why two labs starved. Production stats said green was in surplus, so I had to inspect belts and inserters by hand before I saw the lab inserters had no green-pack source. (2) What I was missing: a per-lab view of which pack each lab lacks and which inserter feeds it, and one tool call that shows the whole lab chain layout. The 20s wait cap and the repeated 'idle' nags also slowed me. (3) What confused me: 'made vs used' includes belt-fill transients, and the map's offset coordinates are easy to misread. (4) Not done: boiler coal is still hand-fed (about 1100 coal, 40+ min), the lab-2 gear chest is still hand-fed, and the burner outpost near [gps=80,68] is unfuelled. (5) Next time: I'd inspect the starved labs' inserter pickup/drop tiles first, and start the coal belt for power sooner."], "phase": "train-3", "cycle": 3}
