{"run": "20261020-011542-t-power-line-sonnet-i3", "scenario": "t-power-line", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.118, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 2.0, "calls": 18, "obj_secs": {"power-the-block": 121}, "think_min": 0.4, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 7, "extra_looks": 3, "waste": 0.167, "cost_per_met": 0.118, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:take", "build", "find", "inspect", "look", "marks", "say", "techs"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 0.44, "blueprint/line building": 0.37, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 0.44}, "by_tool": {"say": 6, "find": 3, "look": 2, "act": 2, "inspect": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "build": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: 1) The pole line was quick. Finding materials took the longest, because I started with almost nothing and had to look for the 100-pole chest at [gps=-12,-27].", "2) I was missing a clear view of what's in shared chests, since marks was empty. A stock summary or a materials mark on the chests would have saved a search. 3) Nothing failed, but the poles' \"energy 0\" readout was confusing, so I confirmed power by checking the assemblers instead.", "4) Next time I'd also check fuel and coal supply during the first look. I only fixed one boiler by hand, and iron fell from 205 to 19 per minute because the furnaces and drills ran out of coal. The real fix is a coal belt from the patch at [gps=47,93], which I didn't build."], "phase": "train-5", "cycle": 5}
{"run": "20261020-011542-t-cross-bus-sonnet-i6", "scenario": "t-cross-bus", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.151, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 3.0, "calls": 24, "obj_secs": {"copper-across-bus": 181}, "think_min": 0.8, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 1, "looks": 10, "extra_looks": 3, "waste": 0.208, "cost_per_met": 0.151, "top_failures": [["FAILED route needs N transport-belt but you have N (and not the ingredients to craft N)", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED route needs N transport-belt but you have N (and not the ingredients to craft N)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:connect", "act:move", "act:rotate", "act:take", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"waiting on jobs": 0.55, "hand building": 0.27, "walking": 0.08, "failed calls": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.84}, "by_tool": {"say": 6, "inspect": 6, "act": 4, "look": 2, "wait": 2, "techs": 1, "map": 1, "marks": 1, "find": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: most time went to finding belts, since I started empty-handed and had to search for the stock chests at [gps=-10,-28]. Missing: a way to see what each stock chest holds without walking there, and the exact belt end tile.", "Confusing: connect from [-45,82] laid a parallel belt a row above the old one instead of joining it. I only noticed when I inspected the start, then rotated one tile to fix it. I should have checked the junction right after building.", "Next time: inspect both belt ends before routing, and grab materials first. I also left the boiler and furnace fuel alerts and the idle labs untouched, since the order was only the copper line."], "phase": "train-5", "cycle": 5}
{"run": "20261020-011759-t-smelter-column-sonnet-i3", "scenario": "t-smelter-column", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.228, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 3.0, "calls": 26, "obj_secs": {"eight-furnaces": 181}, "think_min": 0.9, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 13, "extra_looks": 7, "waste": 0.269, "cost_per_met": 0.228, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:connect", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 0.32, "idle (nothing running)": 0.03, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "waiting on jobs": 0.0, "thinking": 0.87}, "by_tool": {"inspect": 8, "say": 5, "act": 4, "look": 2, "find": 2, "wait": 2, "techs": 1, "map": 1, "marks": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: most time went to finding materials, since I started with almost nothing and had to locate the depot chests near [gps=-10,-28] first. Missing: a marked list of where stock lives (marks was empty) and a coal check on the ore belt before I built. Confusing: furnaces showed energy but no fuel, and I only caught it by inspecting after the build. Placing 16 inserters by hand worked but was long. Next time I'd check belt contents for coal first, add a coal feed or fuel the furnaces up front, and put the build on the board with a done_when check."], "phase": "train-5", "cycle": 5}
