{"run": "20261020-012436-t-steel-sonnet-i1", "scenario": "t-steel", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.216, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 3.0, "calls": 29, "obj_secs": {"steel": 181}, "think_min": 1.0, "idle_min": 0.3, "failed_calls": 2, "undone": 0, "looks": 10, "extra_looks": 2, "waste": 0.138, "cost_per_met": 0.216, "top_failures": [["error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", 1], ["FAILED pipe won't accept coal", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED pipe won't accept coal", "error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "diagnose", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait", "work"], "lost_min": {"failed calls": 0.35, "idle (nothing running)": 0.33, "waiting on jobs": 0.21, "hand building": 0.12, "crafting/fetching": 0.05, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 0.98}, "by_tool": {"say": 8, "look": 5, "act": 5, "wait": 3, "find": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "map": 1, "inspect": 1, "work": 1, "diagnose": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: most time went to walking, about 100 tiles each way between the stock chests at [gps=-12,-28] and the belt at [gps=-55,84]. I had nothing in my inventory at the start and had to find the depot first.", "I was missing a depot mark, because the stock chests had no labels and I only found them by scanning. A \"what's in shared chests\" query would have saved a few calls.", "Two things confused me. The inserter drop position printed as y+0.2, which looked odd but worked. My 4th chest placed late and the look output didn't show it, so I almost doubted the build.", "Next time I'd take everything in one trip (including enough chests and poles) and check chest and pole counts before leaving the depot. I'd also check the power alerts first, since the boilers ran out of coal during the job."], "phase": "train-5", "cycle": 5}
