{"run": "20261020-031253-d4-library-sonnet-i6", "scenario": "d4-library", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.086, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 2.0, "calls": 13, "obj_secs": {"two-more-smelters": 121}, "think_min": 0.3, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 4, "extra_looks": 0, "waste": 0.0, "cost_per_met": 0.086, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["build", "find_space", "inspect", "look", "say", "techs"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 0.93, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.28}, "by_tool": {"say": 6, "build": 2, "inspect": 2, "look": 1, "techs": 1, "find_space": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: the stamps took the most time, about 30s each, and everything else was quick.", "I wasn't missing any tools or items. The stamp pulled its own materials. I hadn't read the design's full ore and plate belt layout before stamping, so I don't know where ore should enter.", "The second stamp returned \"paused ... built 48\", which looked like a failure but wasn't. I only knew it was fine after inspecting the entities.", "Next time I'd fix the boiler fuel and the idle labs first. The base went from 205 to 16 iron per minute while I built smelters nobody can feed yet. I'd also ask where the ore comes from before building them."], "phase": "train-9", "cycle": 9}
{"run": "20261020-031312-d4-library-sonnet-i3", "scenario": "d4-library", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.107, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 2.0, "calls": 14, "obj_secs": {"two-more-smelters": 121}, "think_min": 0.3, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 4, "extra_looks": 0, "waste": 0.0, "cost_per_met": 0.107, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:insert", "act:move", "build", "find_space", "inspect", "look", "say", "stop", "techs"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 1.19, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "hand building": 0.0, "thinking": 0.29}, "by_tool": {"say": 4, "build": 3, "look": 2, "techs": 1, "find_space": 1, "inspect": 1, "act": 1, "stop": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: the stamps went quickly. The first built in 40s and the second paused once, then finished. The build controller fetched and crafted the materials even though I started with only 8 plates.\nMissing: the stamp result said \"paused ... 0 ghosts left\" with no reason, so I had to look at the entities myself to confirm the second block was complete. The look output was also long and cut off at the radius, so I couldn't count all 12 furnaces.\nConfusing: I didn't know where the first block's power came from until I inspected the inserters.\nNext time: I'd confirm each stamp with a ghost check and a status count straight after building, and I'd fuel every furnace in one pass instead of leaving six empty."], "phase": "train-9", "cycle": 9}
