{"run": "20261020-042720-t-belt-ore-sonnet-i4", "scenario": "t-belt-ore", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.27, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 4.0, "calls": 40, "obj_secs": {"ore-to-furnaces": 241}, "think_min": 0.6, "idle_min": 0.9, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 0, "looks": 21, "extra_looks": 11, "waste": 0.3, "cost_per_met": 0.27, "top_failures": [["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and ", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and "], "ops_used": ["act", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "build", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "say", "techs", "wait", "work"], "lost_min": {"idle (nothing running)": 0.92, "waiting on jobs": 0.34, "hand building": 0.3, "blueprint/line building": 0.18, "walking": 0.17, "failed calls": 0.15, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 0.62}, "by_tool": {"inspect": 12, "say": 6, "act": 5, "wait": 4, "look": 3, "find": 3, "map": 3, "build": 2, "techs": 1, "work": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/3: The longest part was the first call, because look only shows entities around me, so finding the drills and furnaces meant find plus map reads. Next was fetching plates from furnaces to build the belt.", "Debrief 2/3: I was missing an iron stockpile and a way to look at a remote coordinate. The belt tool also made a start belt off the drill line and left no join, so I had to place two joining belts by hand at [gps=80,-42] and [gps=103,-40].", "Debrief 3/3: I misread map rows by one tile, and the two ends of my line sat unconnected until I inspected them. Next time I'd inspect the end tiles before running the line, and I'd have a coal and boiler fix ready. I did not do that fix."], "phase": "train-12", "cycle": 12}
