{"run": "20261020-044941-t-starved-sonnet-i3", "scenario": "t-starved", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.232, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 2.0, "calls": 36, "obj_secs": {"red-running": 120}, "think_min": 1.3, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 1, "looks": 13, "extra_looks": 5, "waste": 0.167, "cost_per_met": 0.232, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:research", "act:rotate", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"waiting on jobs": 0.63, "walking": 0.33, "hand building": 0.05, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 1.28}, "by_tool": {"act": 9, "say": 8, "look": 6, "inspect": 4, "techs": 3, "wait": 3, "find": 3}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/4: Most time went to finding things. The ping pointed at red science at 51,5, but the labs were 75 tiles away at -22,-37, and I only found that with find name=lab. Walking and queue lag also ate time (research queue ops lagged behind the techs readout).", "2/4: Missing: a base overview (where the labs are, what feeds what, which assemblers have no output path) and an item stock to build with. I carried only 8 iron plates, so I reused the old labs, inserters and poles instead of building new.", "3/4: Confusing: look is centered on me, not the ping location, so my first look at 51,5 showed nothing. The infinity chests and the energy interface made it unclear what counts as real automation. Also unverified: I never measured pack throughput. Base said made red 3/min, so expect ~3 to 6.", "4/4: Next time I'd run find for labs and assemblers first, then trace the pack path end to end before touching anything. I'd also use all 3 assemblers with a pack belt instead of a single-assembler chain, and take the boiler fuel and the no-coal furnaces at [gps=74,69] earlier because they'll stall everything."], "phase": "train-12", "cycle": 12}
{"run": "20261020-044723-t-steel-sonnet-i5", "scenario": "t-steel", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.203, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 6.0, "calls": 28, "obj_secs": {"steel": 362}, "think_min": 1.0, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 0, "looks": 8, "extra_looks": 4, "waste": 0.179, "cost_per_met": 0.203, "top_failures": [["FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept copper-ore", 1], ["FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by small-electric-pole@N,N", 1], ["FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept coal", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by small-electric-pole@N,N", "FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept coal", "FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept copper-ore"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "notes", "recipes", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"waiting on jobs": 2.79, "failed calls": 0.4, "hand building": 0.33, "crafting/fetching": 0.33, "walking": 0.23, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.01}, "by_tool": {"act": 8, "say": 7, "look": 3, "inspect": 2, "find": 2, "techs": 1, "map": 1, "recipes": 1, "marks": 1, "wait": 1, "notes": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: Most time went on the ~120-tile round trip to find stone and copper, since I started with one furnace and 8 plates.", "Missing: a stock chest with stone, furnaces and circuits, and a way to see where the nearest copper plates or inserters were.", "Confused me: my first furnace placement failed because a pole was in the way and the later steps ran anyway. The copper furnace was far from the ore for no good reason.", "Next time: check shared chests and the infinity chests before leaving, and use burner inserters to cut the copper need. I'd also place with an explicit stop_on_fail and save this steel layout as a design."], "phase": "train-12", "cycle": 12}
