e, about 70 tiles each way, because I carried almost nothing. I was missing iron plates and copper in my inventory, and a stocked chest nearby. What confused me: infinity chests supply the south coal, so the coal isn't actually mined. Next time I'd check item sources and stock up before building, and I'd have fixed the north boiler feed first."], "phase": "train-12", "cycle": 12}
