{"run": "20261020-052526-d4-library-sonnet-i1", "scenario": "d4-library", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.09, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 2.0, "calls": 13, "obj_secs": {"two-more-smelters": 121}, "think_min": 0.3, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 5, "extra_looks": 0, "waste": 0.0, "cost_per_met": 0.09, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["build", "find_space", "inspect", "look", "say", "techs"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 1.2, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.31}, "by_tool": {"say": 4, "build": 3, "inspect": 3, "look": 1, "techs": 1, "find_space": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: 1) The stamps themselves were quick, about 40s each. The slow part was working out whether they were powered, since the build result never says. 2) I was missing a way to confirm grid power without inspecting individual inserters. 3) The second stamp paused with \"0 ghosts left\", which was confusing. It had in fact finished. 4) The base is not running right now. Labs are idle, one boiler at [gps=-31.5,-43] is out of fuel (its neighbour still has coal, and the chest feeding it holds 60), and 32 drills and furnaces are out of fuel. 5) Next time I'd check power and fuel first, then queue research, before any building."], "phase": "train-13", "cycle": 13}
