{"run": "20261020-052319-t-deliver-sonnet-i2", "scenario": "t-deliver", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.15, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 5.0, "calls": 26, "obj_secs": {"chest-filled": 301}, "think_min": 0.7, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 2, "undone": 0, "looks": 8, "extra_looks": 3, "waste": 0.192, "cost_per_met": 0.15, "top_failures": [["error: no entity called iron-plate (did you mean iron-chest, iron-ore, iron-stromatolite?)", 1], ["error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", "error: no entity called iron-plate (did you mean iron-chest, iron-ore, iron-stromatolite?)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 2.29, "waiting on jobs": 1.49, "walking": 0.19, "crafting/fetching": 0.01, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "failed calls": 0.0, "thinking": 0.73}, "by_tool": {"say": 7, "act": 6, "find": 4, "wait": 3, "look": 2, "inspect": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: 1) Most time went to copper: the base had none, so I hand-mined 35 ore and smelted it myself (~3 min), then made a second trip when I was 6 inserters short.", "2) Missing: a stock inventory (no marked chests, I started with 8 plates) and a copper source. 3) Confusing: I queued 50 belts and got 100, because the craft count is crafts, not items. Your two \"take them from stock\" messages had no item named, so I had to ask.", "4) Next time: check production and stock for copper before promising inserters, and calc the exact plate counts first. I'd also propose a real copper smelter and coal belt, since the fuel, boiler and idle-lab alerts were left unfixed."], "phase": "train-13", "cycle": 13}
{"run": "20261020-052447-t-deliver-sonnet-i6", "scenario": "t-deliver", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.205, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 5.0, "calls": 32, "obj_secs": {"chest-filled": 301}, "think_min": 0.7, "idle_min": 0.3, "failed_calls": 3, "undone": 0, "looks": 13, "extra_looks": 8, "waste": 0.344, "cost_per_met": 0.205, "top_failures": [["error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", 1], ["FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by small-electric-pole@N,N; nearest free", 1], ["FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept coal", 1], ["FAILED cannot craft inserter: missing ingredients", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED cannot craft inserter: missing ingredients", "FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by small-electric-pole@N,N; nearest free", "FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept coal", "error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "marks", "production", "say", "wait"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 1.79, "waiting on jobs": 1.67, "failed calls": 0.4, "idle (nothing running)": 0.33, "crafting/fetching": 0.07, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 0.66}, "by_tool": {"say": 9, "act": 7, "find": 5, "inspect": 4, "look": 3, "wait": 2, "marks": 1, "production": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: most time went to getting copper, since there was no copper production. I walked about 90 tiles each way to hand-mine ore and smelt it in furnaces I placed myself.", "Missing: a map of where stock and plates sit. I only found the 100 plates in the chests and the 100 plates in each full-output furnace at [gps=74,26] by searching, and I had no copper plate stock to look for.", "Confusing bits: craft count means recipes, not items, so \"50 belts\" made 100 (I had 50 spare). The \"them\" messages had no item named. I also took the plates and furnaces from the chests at [gps=-16,-22] without knowing whose they were.", "Next time: check stock and chests first, work out the whole raw-plate bill before crafting, ask which item an ambiguous message means, and put the order on the board with a done_when check. I never did that this time."], "phase": "train-13", "cycle": 13}
{"run": "20261020-052723-d4-library-sonnet-i5", "scenario": "d4-library", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.068, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 1.0, "calls": 11, "obj_secs": {"two-more-smelters": 60}, "think_min": 0.3, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 3, "extra_looks": 0, "waste": 0.0, "cost_per_met": 0.068, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["build", "find_space", "look", "marks", "say", "stamp", "techs", "zone"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 0.7, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.28}, "by_tool": {"look": 2, "zone": 2, "stamp": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "find_space": 1, "build": 1, "say": 1}, "debrief": [], "phase": "train-13", "cycle": 13}
{"run": "20261020-052311-t-brownout-sonnet-i3", "scenario": "t-brownout", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.465, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 7.0, "calls": 58, "obj_secs": {"power-steady": 422}, "think_min": 2.0, "idle_min": 0.3, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 27, "extra_looks": 13, "waste": 0.224, "cost_per_met": 0.465, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "build", "designs", "diagnose", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "post_task", "say", "skill_run", "status", "techs", "update_task", "wait", "zone"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 1.75, "hand building": 1.34, "walking": 0.4, "idle (nothing running)": 0.33, "looking": 0.01, "other": 0.0, "own scripts": 0.0, "thinking": 1.98}, "by_tool": {"act": 11, "look": 9, "say": 7, "find": 7, "inspect": 5, "diagnose": 4, "map": 2, "post_task": 2, "update_task": 2, "build": 2, "techs": 1, "status": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: (1) Most time went to walking: the sites are 50-130 tiles apart, so my hand-fixes were slow. (2) I was missing a power-grid overview (which sites share a grid, and load against capacity) and copper plates; small poles need copper, and I had to take it from a science assembler. (3) Confusing: the first board check was malformed (assembling-machine-1, no zone), and the stamp reports \"paused\" even after building most of the pieces. (4) Unfinished: the copper smelting column at [gps=0,72] is only partly built and has no coal; the burner arrays are hand-fueled only. (5) Next time I'd read the whole base first, then build a coal belt before anything else, since fuel is the root cause of the outages."], "phase": "train-13", "cycle": 13}
{"run": "20261020-053158-t-cross-bus-sonnet-i6", "scenario": "t-cross-bus", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.157, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 4.0, "calls": 28, "obj_secs": {"copper-across-bus": 241}, "think_min": 1.0, "idle_min": 0.3, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 0, "looks": 12, "extra_looks": 5, "waste": 0.214, "cost_per_met": 0.157, "top_failures": [["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and ", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and "], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "build", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "stop", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"waiting on jobs": 0.58, "idle (nothing running)": 0.33, "blueprint/line building": 0.29, "hand building": 0.22, "failed calls": 0.08, "crafting/fetching": 0.04, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.02}, "by_tool": {"inspect": 8, "say": 6, "act": 3, "build": 2, "find": 2, "wait": 2, "look": 1, "techs": 1, "map": 1, "marks": 1, "stop": 1}, "debrief": ["Picking up the boiler fuel at [gps=-31,-43] while waiting for orders.", "Debrief: 1) Most time went to a belt that missed the source by one tile (my line started at y=81.5, the source belt was at y=82.5); I only caught it by inspecting the output chest. 2) I was missing materials: I had to find the stock chests at [gps=-12,-29] for belts and plates. 3) The route tool's output didn't show which row it started on, and the map's x offset confused me. 4) Next time I'd inspect both ends of a belt and check the chest right after building, not after a wait. I stopped before the boiler refuel finished, so [gps=-31,-43] may still be out of fuel."], "phase": "train-14", "cycle": 14}
{"run": "20261020-053158-t-belt-ore-sonnet-i1", "scenario": "t-belt-ore", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.261, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 5.0, "calls": 42, "obj_secs": {"ore-to-furnaces": 302}, "think_min": 1.3, "idle_min": 0.9, "failed_calls": 2, "undone": 0, "looks": 20, "extra_looks": 9, "waste": 0.262, "cost_per_met": 0.261, "top_failures": [["error: no entity called iron-plate (did you mean iron-chest, iron-ore, iron-stromatolite?)", 1], ["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and ", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["error: no entity called iron-plate (did you mean iron-chest, iron-ore, iron-stromatolite?)", "exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and "], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "build", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait", "work"], "lost_min": {"idle (nothing running)": 0.92, "waiting on jobs": 0.61, "crafting/fetching": 0.19, "blueprint/line building": 0.18, "walking": 0.17, "failed calls": 0.14, "hand building": 0.1, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.32}, "by_tool": {"inspect": 9, "say": 7, "wait": 6, "look": 4, "act": 4, "map": 4, "find": 3, "build": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "work": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: 1) Most time went to the fresh session starting with no memory. The board and roadmap were empty and the base showed copper 0 and no research, so I had to rediscover the state.", "2) Missing: notes of what was built and where, and a clear next goal. Per-minute rates for iron, copper and science, plus a map of the belts, would have helped most.", "3) Nothing failed this session because I took no actions. Confusing: the \"thanks, that one's done\" message had no task attached, and I couldn't tell what \"that one\" was.", "4) Next time I'd update my notes after every build and keep a roadmap on the board. First I'd fix the copper smelting and get the labs running, since research is the clock."], "phase": "train-14", "cycle": 14}
