{"run": "20261020-053937-t-red-block-sonnet-i5", "scenario": "t-red-block", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.368, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 6.0, "calls": 48, "obj_secs": {"red-block": 362}, "think_min": 2.5, "idle_min": 1.7, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 1, "looks": 12, "extra_looks": 2, "waste": 0.062, "cost_per_met": 0.368, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:research", "act:rotate", "act:set_recipe", "act:take", "act:wait", "build", "designs", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "notes", "say", "stamp", "techs", "wait", "work"], "lost_min": {"idle (nothing running)": 1.67, "hand building": 0.97, "waiting on jobs": 0.69, "walking": 0.22, "crafting/fetching": 0.09, "blueprint/line building": 0.08, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 2.45}, "by_tool": {"act": 13, "say": 11, "inspect": 6, "wait": 4, "look": 3, "techs": 2, "stamp": 2, "find": 2, "designs": 1, "map": 1, "build": 1, "work": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/4: Most of my time went on the 130-tile walk between the science block at y=95 and the labs at y=-37, plus working out why nothing was researching (empty labs, nothing queued).", "2/4: I was missing a map of the base (what feeds what, and where coal is), a way to carry stock without walking, and coal. Nearly everything is hand-fed, and the alerts show 32 furnaces and drills plus a boiler with no fuel.", "3/4: What confused me: the briefing said labs 0/2 and \"iron 0 copper 0\" while belts were full of plates, so the dashboard numbers didn't match what I saw. The labs also sit far from the science block with no link between them.", "4/4: Next time I'd check labs, power and coal first, then build the coal belt and the pack belt before anything else. I'd also put the labs next to the science block. I didn't get to the gears off the iron belt that you asked for. I stopped as soon as you called time, so there are no half-built ghosts."], "phase": "train-14", "cycle": 14}
