{"run": "20261020-055639-t-belt-ore-sonnet-i4", "scenario": "t-belt-ore", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.19, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 4.0, "calls": 35, "obj_secs": {"ore-to-furnaces": 241}, "think_min": 0.8, "idle_min": 0.9, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 0, "looks": 16, "extra_looks": 7, "waste": 0.229, "cost_per_met": 0.19, "top_failures": [["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and ", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["exception: line failed after N leg(s): route needs N underground-belt but you have N (and "], "ops_used": ["act", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "build", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"idle (nothing running)": 0.88, "blueprint/line building": 0.27, "hand building": 0.08, "failed calls": 0.08, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 0.85}, "by_tool": {"inspect": 10, "say": 9, "map": 3, "act": 3, "wait": 3, "look": 2, "build": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "find": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/4: Most time went to finding materials (I started with 8 plates, and the belt and underground stock was in chests near spawn) and to the walk to the build site.", "Debrief 2/4: I was missing a map of the shared chests and a stock mark. I had to scan with look to find belts and undergrounds.", "Debrief 3/4: The line tool said \"placed all\", but it left two gaps: one tile at the furnace belt's start and a one-row offset at the drills' end. Ore only arrived after I checked belt lanes by hand and patched both.", "Debrief 4/4: Next time I'd inspect the endpoint belts' exact tiles and directions before routing, and verify ore reaches the furnaces right after building. I'd also have queued research and the boiler fuel, which I left unfixed."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
