{"run": "20261020-061102-t-steel-sonnet-i6", "scenario": "t-steel", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.223, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 6.0, "calls": 33, "obj_secs": {"steel": 362}, "think_min": 1.1, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 2, "undone": 0, "looks": 9, "extra_looks": 4, "waste": 0.182, "cost_per_met": 0.223, "top_failures": [["FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by transport-belt@N,N, transport-belt@N", 1], ["FAILED transport-belt won't accept coal", 1], ["FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by small-electric-pole@N,N", 1], ["FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept coal", 1], ["FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept copper-ore", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by small-electric-pole@N,N", "FAILED cannot place stone-furnace at N,N: blocked by transport-belt@N,N, transport-belt@N", "FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept coal", "FAILED small-electric-pole won't accept copper-ore", "FAILED transport-belt won't accept coal"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "production", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"waiting on jobs": 2.87, "hand building": 0.47, "crafting/fetching": 0.39, "walking": 0.23, "failed calls": 0.13, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.07}, "by_tool": {"act": 10, "say": 8, "inspect": 3, "wait": 3, "look": 2, "marks": 2, "find": 2, "techs": 1, "map": 1, "production": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: Most time went on the 120-tile round trip east for stone and copper ore, because I started with only 8 iron plates and no circuits.", "Missing: a starter kit (furnaces, inserters, poles) or a chest with copper plate and stone near the belt. I also didn't know the infinity chests were free to take from until I inspected them.", "Failed: I placed furnaces on a belt and on a pole while smelting copper, wasting two trips. Output counts were also confusing: production showed 16 steel/min, but the four furnaces can only make about 3.4 steel/min.", "Next time: run find_space or map before placing, and check the infinity chests before leaving. I'd also craft the stone furnaces, copper cable and inserters in the background while walking."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-061356-t-brownout-sonnet-i1", "scenario": "t-brownout", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.304, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 4.0, "calls": 37, "obj_secs": {"power-steady": 241}, "think_min": 1.4, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 2, "undone": 0, "looks": 21, "extra_looks": 12, "waste": 0.378, "cost_per_met": 0.304, "top_failures": [["error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", 1], ["FAILED cannot hand-craft pipe (category crafting)", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED cannot hand-craft pipe (category crafting)", "error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "act:wait", "diagnose", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "production", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 0.36, "failed calls": 0.21, "waiting on jobs": 0.18, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.37}, "by_tool": {"find": 7, "act": 7, "say": 6, "inspect": 6, "diagnose": 3, "look": 2, "map": 2, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "production": 1, "wait": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: 1) Most time went to finding materials. I only found the stock chests near [gps=-12,-28] after asking you for copper, and I walked back and forth about 150 tiles between the two power plants. 2) I was missing a \"where is the stock\" view: marks was empty, and find by item name didn't work for plates. 3) Confusing: diagnose said \"no obvious shortage\" while the inserter at the infinity chest still showed low_power, and I had to guess the pole layout for the new engines. 4) Next time I'd check the chests with a wide inspect first, then build the south boilers straight away instead of hand-fueling the north ones. 5) Left undone: the north boilers are still hand-fed, labs are idle (science assembler lacks gears), and the 32 unfueled furnaces and drills near [gps=74,69] are untouched."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
