{"run": "20261020-061727-t-deliver-sonnet-i6", "scenario": "t-deliver", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.119, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 1.0, "calls": 16, "obj_secs": {"chest-filled": 60}, "think_min": 0.3, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 0, "looks": 5, "extra_looks": 2, "waste": 0.188, "cost_per_met": 0.119, "top_failures": [["error: no entity called iron-plate (did you mean iron-chest, iron-ore, iron-stromatolite?)", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["error: no entity called iron-plate (did you mean iron-chest, iron-ore, iron-stromatolite?)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:take", "find", "inspect", "look", "marks", "say", "status", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"waiting on jobs": 0.19, "hand building": 0.16, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "failed calls": 0.0, "thinking": 0.31}, "by_tool": {"say": 4, "look": 3, "act": 3, "techs": 1, "marks": 1, "find": 1, "inspect": 1, "status": 1, "wait": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: the inserter and belt delivery went quickly because the depot chests held stock. Most of the time went to finding what to do: the base was idle, I started with nearly empty pockets, and there was no roadmap or board. I was missing a one-call overview of stock chests (marks was empty), and the power alert gave no route to the coal. The coal refuel was only a stopgap, and I never touched the 32 out-of-fuel furnaces or the idle labs. Next time I'd mark the depot chests on arrival and start a coal belt for the boilers and a science line without waiting for a reply."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-061313-t-starved-sonnet-i5", "scenario": "t-starved", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.315, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 2.0, "calls": 43, "obj_secs": {"red-running": 120}, "think_min": 1.5, "idle_min": 2.7, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 1, "looks": 18, "extra_looks": 5, "waste": 0.14, "cost_per_met": 0.315, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:research", "act:rotate", "act:take", "act:wait", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "post_task", "production", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"idle (nothing running)": 2.72, "walking": 0.85, "hand building": 0.24, "waiting on jobs": 0.03, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.46}, "by_tool": {"look": 10, "act": 10, "say": 8, "wait": 5, "find": 4, "inspect": 2, "techs": 1, "post_task": 1, "production": 1, "map": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/3: The most time went on surveying the base. The base is sprawling and mostly hand-fed. I found stranded stock: about 2300 coal in chests at [gps=42,105] and over 1000 iron plates backed up in the furnaces at [gps=74,38]. The fixes I did were small: a copper belt tile facing the wrong way, and hand-fuelling the boilers once.", "Debrief 2/3: I was missing materials, since I started with 8 plates and no copper. I also lacked a base map showing which power or coal feeds what, and a tool to measure belt routes. Confusing: `look` centers on my position rather than a given x,y. Hand-crafting 286 belts ate all my plates and a lot of time.", "Debrief 3/3: Nothing is automated yet. The coal belt to the boilers (about 210 tiles) isn't laid, and the boilers are running on the coal I fed them by hand. Next time I'd go straight to `build kind=line` for the long belt, and craft belts in assemblers instead of by hand. I'd also put the first board task up sooner."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-061810-t-deliver-sonnet-i1", "scenario": "t-deliver", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.148, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 1.0, "calls": 24, "obj_secs": {"chest-filled": 60}, "think_min": 0.6, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 10, "extra_looks": 5, "waste": 0.208, "cost_per_met": 0.148, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:take", "find", "inspect", "look", "marks", "notes", "production", "say", "wait", "work"], "lost_min": {"hand building": 0.85, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "waiting on jobs": 0.0, "thinking": 0.59}, "by_tool": {"say": 8, "inspect": 4, "find": 4, "act": 2, "look": 1, "work": 1, "marks": 1, "production": 1, "wait": 1, "notes": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/4: The inserter and belt order took only a few calls. Most of my time went on reading the base to find stock and then working out that the boilers are fed from a hand-filled chest, 140 tiles from any coal drill.", "2/4: I was missing a map of what the base consists of (where the power, coal and science are) and a way to search containers by item. I had to inspect areas blindly to find the depot.", "3/4: Nothing failed outright. One thing was misleading: craft said it made 29 belts when I asked for 50, and the chest still received 50 because my own 8 belts and the 21 I'd carried covered the gap. I had to check my inventory to see that. I also never got a reply to my coal-belt question.", "4/4: Next time I'd check stock before crafting and take belts from the depot if they're there. I'd also start on the root problems from the alerts (the boiler coal supply, the idle labs) sooner, rather than only reporting them and waiting for an answer."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-061811-d4-library-sonnet-i4", "scenario": "d4-library", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.126, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 1.0, "calls": 19, "obj_secs": {"two-more-smelters": 60}, "think_min": 0.8, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 5, "extra_looks": 0, "waste": 0.0, "cost_per_met": 0.126, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:take", "build", "find", "find_space", "inspect", "look", "say", "stamp", "techs"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 0.67, "hand building": 0.11, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.75}, "by_tool": {"say": 7, "act": 3, "stamp": 2, "inspect": 2, "look": 1, "techs": 1, "find_space": 1, "build": 1, "find": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief 1/4: The stamp and build were quick (96 entities in 40s), and the build controller fetched and crafted the materials itself, though I started with nearly nothing. The time went on the power outage: walking to the boiler at [gps=-31.5,-43], and a big inspect dump that cost a lot of reading.", "2/4: Missing: a cheap way to check whether power reached the new block, since poles showed energy 0. I also lacked a coal source, so I took coal from the furnaces and a chest, which was sloppy. I should have asked first.", "3/4: Confusing: inspect with a large radius returns every belt tile, which is far too noisy. I also never re-checked after refueling that the grid came back.", "4/4: Next time I'd make the coal belt for the boilers first, since the base was stalled on fuel. I'd verify power with a single inserter inspect after building, and I'd post board tasks with done_when checks from the start."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-061340-t-brownout-sonnet-i2", "scenario": "t-brownout", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.26, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 4.0, "calls": 32, "obj_secs": {"power-steady": 241}, "think_min": 1.6, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 3, "undone": 0, "looks": 19, "extra_looks": 12, "waste": 0.469, "cost_per_met": 0.26, "top_failures": [["FAILED no small-electric-pole in inventory", 2], ["FAILED cannot craft small-electric-pole: missing ingredients", 1], ["error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", 1], ["error: no entity called copper-cable (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED cannot craft small-electric-pole: missing ingredients", "FAILED no small-electric-pole in inventory", "error: no entity called copper-cable (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)", "error: no entity called copper-plate (did you mean copper-ore, copper-stromatolite?)"], "ops_used": ["act", "act:craft", "act:insert", "act:mine", "act:move", "act:place", "act:take", "find", "inspect", "look", "map", "marks", "say", "techs", "wait"], "lost_min": {"walking": 0.32, "waiting on jobs": 0.2, "hand building": 0.17, "failed calls": 0.01, "looking": 0.0, "other": 0.0, "thinking": 1.61}, "by_tool": {"inspect": 7, "find": 6, "act": 6, "look": 5, "say": 3, "wait": 2, "techs": 1, "map": 1, "marks": 1}, "debrief": [], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-061843-d4-library-sonnet-i3", "scenario": "d4-library", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.103, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 1.0, "calls": 19, "obj_secs": {"two-more-smelters": 60}, "think_min": 0.5, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 0, "undone": 0, "looks": 5, "extra_looks": 1, "waste": 0.053, "cost_per_met": 0.103, "top_failures": [], "failure_kinds": [], "ops_used": ["act", "act:insert", "act:move", "act:take", "build", "find", "find_space", "inspect", "look", "say", "stamp", "techs", "zone"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 0.68, "hand building": 0.14, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.45}, "by_tool": {"say": 7, "look": 2, "zone": 2, "stamp": 2, "techs": 1, "find_space": 1, "build": 1, "inspect": 1, "find": 1, "act": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: the smelter job was quick. find_space, two stamps and one build call took about 40s, and the inserters show powered.", "Missing: I started with an empty inventory. The stamp's fetch/craft/mine step still found the materials. I also had no map of the base, so I didn't know where ore, coal and copper are until I searched.", "Confusing: the east smelter's furnaces came up with no fuel and the west one had 10 coal each, and I don't know why. The stamp result also doesn't say whether the poles connect to the grid, so I had to read inserter status to check.", "Next time: before building, I'd check what is actually stalling the base. Nothing is researching, there's no copper, and the boiler's coal chest is hand-fed. I'd fix coal and copper first, then add smelters."], "phase": "train-15", "cycle": 15}
{"run": "20261020-062020-t-stamp-book-sonnet-i4", "scenario": "t-stamp-book", "commit": "e08d89e", "success": true, "score": 1.0, "objectives": 1, "met": 1, "cost": 0.071, "usage_limit": false, "errors": [], "minutes": 1.0, "calls": 10, "obj_secs": {"smelter-down": 60}, "think_min": 0.5, "idle_min": 0.0, "failed_calls": 1, "undone": 0, "looks": 3, "extra_looks": 0, "waste": 0.1, "cost_per_met": 0.071, "top_failures": [["FAILED cannot craft small-electric-pole: missing ingredients", 1], ["FAILED route needs N small-electric-pole but you have N (and not the ingredients to craft ", 1]], "failure_kinds": ["FAILED cannot craft small-electric-pole: missing ingredients", "FAILED route needs N small-electric-pole but you have N (and not the ingredients to craft "], "ops_used": ["act", "act:connect", "act:craft", "build", "inspect", "look", "say", "techs"], "lost_min": {"blueprint/line building": 0.5, "failed calls": 0.01, "other": 0.0, "looking": 0.0, "thinking": 0.47}, "by_tool": {"say": 3, "look": 2, "build": 2, "techs": 1, "act": 1, "inspect": 1}, "debrief": ["Debrief: 1) Most time went to the power link. The stamp built in 21s, but it had no grid connection, and I found that only after inspecting it. 2) Missing: the stamp result should say whether it's powered, and I had no poles, wood or copper cable on me (build kind=line fetched them). 3) Confusing: I tried a nonexistent \"connect\" tool by name. The act op worked, but its error text was unclear. 4) My look afterwards showed only 3 of the 4 furnaces and I never counted the fourth, so that's unverified. 5) Next time: check the nearest powered pole before stamping, and verify entity counts right after the build."], "phase": "holdout-after", "cycle": null}
